\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{The potential is a question format}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{optimization}

\p{We formulate #{\Phi} to ask how evaluation performance varies with the
base artifact, admissible information, protocol family, and resource budget.
The definition supplies no scaling exponent and no guarantee that a maximizing
protocol exists.}

\p{Empirical studies provide conditional points or bounds only after their
protocol, evaluator, and costs are embedded in this interface. The same
notation must not be used to promote an observed benchmark maximum to a
universal ceiling.}
